url: "https://github.com/mos3b-faqeeh/agent-integrity-analysis"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mos3b-faqeeh/agent-integrity-analysis"
license: MIT
abstract: >
  Code, human labels and derived data for a study of integrity failures in papers written by AI research
  agents on the Into the Unknown benchmark: a re-analysis of the official judgments, a human-labelled set of
  numerical claims, a deterministic claim-to-evidence checker that certifies a number only when it belongs to
  the result it claims to describe, and a cross-vendor second-judge study.
keywords:
  - AI research agents
  - data provenance
  - claim verification
  - LLM-as-a-judge
  - research integrity
